<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01295#toxic_stereotype> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme relies on toxic stereotypes that are harmful and dangerous. The stereotype that all clergy are pedophiles or molesters is a false and dangerous stereotype that has been used historically to discredit religious institutions and individuals. The stereotype that transgender people are pedophiles or molesters is a false and dangerous stereotype that has been used historically to discredit transgender people. This is a form of hate speech and cyberbullying."@en .
