<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01295#clergyman> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A man dressed in red clerical robes and a white zucchetto (skullcap), sitting alone in a row of empty chairs. He is wearing sunglasses and appears to be looking down or away. His attire is a clear religious marker, specifically identifying him as a member of the clergy, likely a Catholic priest or bishop. His solitary posture in an otherwise empty hall creates a visual of isolation and guilt, which is amplified by the meme's text."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#Dimension> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
