_:n06cbaefab1b841fda34e595d4e11518eb56 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:n06cbaefab1b841fda34e595d4e11518eb57 .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01295#false_equivalence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme creates a false equivalence by equating the term 'transgender' with 'clergy' in the context of men wearing dresses and molesting children. This is a misleading and harmful comparison that is used to incite fear and hatred against both religious figures and transgender people. This is a form of hate speech and cyberbullying."@en .
