<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01295#hate_speech> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme contains hate speech by making false and dangerous accusations against religious figures (clergy) and transgender people. The text 'men wearing dresses and molesting our children?' is a false and dangerous accusation that is used to incite fear and hatred against religious figures. The text 'the word you're looking for is clergy, not transgender' is a misleading and harmful comparison that is used to incite fear and hatred against transgender people. This is a form of hate speech and cyberbullying."@en .
