<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01295#clergy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The term 'clergy' refers to the body of ordained ministers, priests, rabbis, imams, and other religious leaders who serve in a religious institution. In the context of the meme, it is used to refer to religious figures, specifically within the Catholic Church given the attire (red robe and white zucchetto). The meme uses this term to misdirect and stereotype all clergy as pedophiles, which is a false and harmful accusation."@en .
