<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01295#isolated_clergyman> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A clergyman is seated alone in a row of empty chairs, creating a visual of isolation. The scene is framed to emphasize his solitary presence in an otherwise vacant hall, which amplifies the emotional weight of the image."@en .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01295#assertion_about_01295> <http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general#asserts> <http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01295#isolated_clergyman> .
