_:n06cbaefab1b841fda34e595d4e11518eb38 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:n06cbaefab1b841fda34e595d4e11518eb39 .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#OpaqueOverlay> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Text blocks that completely obscure underlying visual content in memes"@en .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01295#clergyman> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#extractedFrom> "01295.png" .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01295#clergyman> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#extractionMethod> "llm_extraction_huggingface" .
