<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01295#transphobic_stereotype> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme uses the term 'transgender' in a derogatory and misleading way, attempting to equate transgender people with clergy by suggesting that 'clergy' is the correct term to describe men wearing dresses and molesting children. This is a false equivalence and contributes to transphobic sentiment, which is a form of hate speech and cyberbullying."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#semiTransparentOverlaidOn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#superimposedOn> .
