<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#ComparativePositioning> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#SemanticAdjacency> .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#superimposedOn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Indicates direct overlay relationship between dimension instances"@en .
