<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#TargetCommunity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Target Community"@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#visuallyCompositionCompliantWith> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Indicates typography that conforms to and enhances the geometric structure of memes"@en .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01295#top_text> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Text content: 'men wearing dresses and molesting our children?' Position: top of the image, spanning the width, in white bold font with black outline."@en .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01295#pedophilia> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Pedophilia is a psychiatric disorder characterized by a primary sexual attraction to prepubescent children. The meme falsely and dangerously implies that all clergy are pedophiles, which is a serious and false accusation. This stereotype is used to incite fear and hatred against religious figures, which is a form of hate speech and cyberbullying."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#underpinsCosmicIronyOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#consilientWith> .
